		{"id":"4519e6a98b69f531","type":"text","text":"[[Book - The History of Orindia (1st Edition)]]\nHints at the possibility that Eraja may still use their train network from the 3rd age. For Eraja this is more likely the case, as they never took up \narms against Orinda Aries\n\nThe excerpt below implies Eraja was sympathetic to the plight of the Orindian royal family.\n\n","x":2891,"y":-226,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"d6c09956a2fd7a67","type":"text","text":"This umbrella located in [[Her Ladyship's Chamber]] could indicate the weather in Eraja as being rainy.","x":2921,"y":-601,"width":340,"height":95},
