		{"id":"134ead34b46e81ff","type":"text","text":"[[Book - The History of Orindia (1st Edition)]]\n\nThe following passage may imply that Arch Aries has a 'tribal' society.\n\nWild, vast, untamed land could indicate horseback as their mode of transport","x":1030,"y":-405,"width":367,"height":245},
