		{"id":"7635f07f8e7647d8","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261020001235.png","x":-300,"y":2260,"width":400,"height":352},
		{"id":"fa1a0d70147246af","type":"text","text":"The Mora Jai Stamp found on the letter in the [[Entrance Hall]] the following:\n\n- The core is shown at the bottom of the stamp amongst the slogan 'The White Sea of Yore'.\n- The ship on the stamp shows they are a 'naval' nation.\n- A naval nation would likely prefer either 'clear' or 'windy' weather. 'Clear' weather appears to be shown on the stamp.\n- Whilst the stamp is blue, this is not a color listed in [[Book - Realm & Rune (Undamaged Copy)]]\n\t- Based on the stamp, 'white' would appear to be the most likely candidate. This theory appears to hold true once the process of elimination is applied.\n\t  \nnote: evidence of their agricultural roots has been found, however I can not recall the source","x":160,"y":2263,"width":500,"height":437},
